***conformance tests***

> a dropped comment inside the section

# create-named-widget
Creating a :Widget: named "a" yields a :Widget: with name "a".

# create-second-widget
A second :Widget: named "b" joins "a" in the :Registry:.

***acceptance tests***

# reject-empty-name
An empty name is rejected and the :Registry: stays unchanged.
